  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T P.919 describes subjective assessment methods for evaluating quality of experience of short (between 10s and 30s) 360 videos. Recommendation ITU-T P.919 also outlines the characteristics of the source sequences to be used, such as duration, type of content and number of sequences. Detailswithin Recommendation ITU-T P.919 are expected to change in subsequent editions, based on experiments into how best to conduct subjective tests with 360 content.</abstract>
